{"at":"2026-02-18T19:35:23.696Z","userId":"admin","page":{"id":574,"status":"published","language":"en","path":"/docs/propertylist-mls-user-manual/getting-started/","title":"Getting Started","description":null,"body":"<article class=\"shortcode_info\" itemscope=\"\" itemtype=\"http://schema.org/Article\">\n\t<div class=\"doc-post-content \" id=\"post\">\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"shortcode_title\"><h1><span style=\"font-size: 28px; letter-spacing: -0.03em; color: rgb(11, 18, 32);\">Getting Started</span></h1><div class=\"ezd-meta dot-sep\"><span class=\"views sep\"><br></span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t<div class=\"doc-scrollable editor-content\">\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"doc-content-wrap\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div data-elementor-type=\"wp-post\" data-elementor-id=\"9632\" class=\"elementor elementor-9632\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-24133c6 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"24133c6\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-472f9a9 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"472f9a9\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Welcome to the PropertyList Community!<br><br></p></div></div></div></div><div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-9a6f448 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"9a6f448\" data-element_type=\"container\"><div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-7433c15 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"7433c15\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h2><strong>What is PropertyList?</strong></h2><p><strong>PropertyList</strong> is a comprehensive real estate platform that offers free listings, users, branded microsites, CRM and other tools to efficiently list, manage, and market properties, with additional paid features available for enhanced functionalities. Pay as you go with no monthly subscriptions.</p><p>This manual provides detailed instructions and information on all aspects of the platform, from <a href=\"/docs/propertylist-mls-user-manual/listing-a-property/import-properties/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">importing your properties</a> to <a href=\"/docs/propertylist-mls-user-manual/pipeline-tracking/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">managing sales pipeline</a>,<span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.15px; text-align: var(--text-align); color: var(--p_color);\">&nbsp;a comprehensive guide to using the PropertyList MLS platform.</span></p><h2><strong>Who should use this manual?</strong></h2><p>This manual is intended for all users of the PropertyList MLS platform. Whether you are a new user or an experienced user, you will find helpful information in this manual. We’re always working on new features to help estate agents close more deals and save time. Keep an eye out for upcoming updates and features!</p><h2><strong>What is included in this manual?</strong></h2><p>This manual includes the following information:</p><ul><li><a href=\"/docs/propertylist-mls-user-manual/listing-a-property/creating-a-new-listing/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>Creating and managing listings</strong></a></li><li><a href=\"https://info-staging.propertylist.es/docs/propertylist-advanced-user-manual/how-to-manage-your-leads/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>Managing leads</strong></a></li><li><a href=\"/docs/propertylist-mls-user-manual/pipeline-tracking/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>Using the Client Pipeline</strong></a></li><li><a href=\"/docs/propertylist-advanced-user-manual/how-to-use-the-calendar/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>Using the PropertyList Calendar</strong></a></li><li><a href=\"/docs/property-portal-manual/reports-and-statistics/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>Generating reports and statistics</strong></a></li><li><a href=\"/forums/forum/employment-opportunities/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>Posting Job Opportunities</strong></a></li><li><a href=\"/docs/propertylist-mls-user-manual/additional-resources/\"><strong>Additional resources</strong></a><br><br></li></ul><h2><strong>How to use this manual</strong></h2><p>This manual is organised into a series of chapters and sections, you can find sections on the left of all document pages. Each chapter covers a different topic, and each section provides detailed instructions on a specific task. You can use the search function to find the exact information you need.</p><p>We hope you find this manual helpful. If you have any questions, please contact <a href=\"/docs/propertylist-mls-user-manual/additional-resources/mls-support/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">PropertyList support</a>.</p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-7f540c9 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"7f540c9\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\"><br></div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t\t<div class=\"details_cont ent recently_added\" id=\"content_elements\"><h4 class=\"c_head\">Articles</h4><ul class=\"article_list\"><li class=\"page_item page-item-10098\"><a href=\"/docs/propertylist-mls-user-manual/getting-started/desktop-and-mobile-friendly/\">Desktop &amp; Mobile Friendly</a></li>\n<li class=\"page_item page-item-12676\"><a href=\"/docs/propertylist-mls-user-manual/getting-started/download-app/\">Download APP</a><br></li></ul></div></div></div>\n    </article>","seo_title":"Getting Started • PropertyList Info Hub","seo_description":null}}